 "type": "manga",
 "attributes": {
  "title": {
   "en": "Genkai Toppa! F-Rank Kengi Mineuchi EX"
  },
  "altTitles": [
   {
    "ja": "限界突破！Fランク剣技みね打ちEX"
   },
   {
    "en": "I Can Stop Anything with My Broken Skill"
   }
  ],
  "description": {
   "en": "Thirty years after the Demon King's disaster, the world is overrun with monsters and dungeons. Adventurers, who prevent dungeon expansion, are now celebrated as heroes. \n\nRenji Ishitome once dreamed of becoming an adventurer, but his level cap was only, and he could only learn the basic skill Mineuchi. With no talent, he gave up and settled for irregular jobs.\n\nHowever, his fate changes when he encounters a new item, Skill Breaker, discovered in an unexplored dungeon area. In a desperate moment, using Skill Breaker evolves Mineuchi into Mineuchi (EX), granting him the ability to stop various things with his enhanced skill.\n\nArmed with his once-weak ability, Renji begins his rise to powerdominating dungeons with Mineuchi (EX)!\n\n---\n\n**TL Note:** Mineuchi (峰打ち) is the act of striking an opponent with the back (spin/ridge) of the sword."
  },
